    "evidence_text": "Matt Thorr\n\nLovin' You's a Dirty Job\n\n The song is known for its anthemic chorus, and Pearcy's raspy vocals.\n\nStephen Pearcy\n\nStephen Eric Pearcy (born July 3, 1956), known as Stephen Pearcy, is an American musician.\n\n He is best known as the founder, singer, and songwriter of the heavy metal band Ratt.\n\n He has also recorded four records as a solo artist.\n\nShame Shame Shame (Ratt song)\n\n The song's lyrics focus mainly on cheating.\n\n The song was co-written by famed songwriter Desmond Child, Ratt guitarist Warren DeMartini and lead singer Stephen Pearcy.\n\nWanted Man (Ratt song)\n\nDance (Ratt song)\n\n\"Dance\" is a song by American heavy metal band Ratt.\n\n It reached #59 on the Billboard Top 100.\n\nEat Me Up Alive\n\nVicious Delite\n\nVicious Delite was an alternative metal band formed by Stephen Pearcy in 1995 after Arcade.\n\n Stephen Pearcy was said to still be in his Ratt form, indeed his voice was just as compelling.\n\n Their first live performance was intense & wonderfully surprising.\n\nSlip of the Lip\n\nAlexander O'Neal",
